'''Usha Martin Limited''' is an Indian multinational company that primarily operates in the steel and [[wire rope]] manufacturing industry. It was founded in 1961 by Basant Kumar Jhawar and is headquartered in [[Kolkata]], [[West Bengal]], [[India]].<ref>{{Cite web |date=8 April 2019 |title=Usha Martin appoints Anirban Sanyal as CFO |url=https://www.livemint.com/companies/people/usha-martin-appoints-anirban-sanyal-as-cfo-1554739761665.html |access-date=2023-06-08 |website=mint |language=en}}</ref> Usha Martin is one of the largest wire rope manufacturers globally.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Up 63% in 2022! Usha Martin is HDFC Securities' top techno funda pick |url=https://mintgenie.livemint.com/news/markets/up-63-in-2022-usha-martin-is-hdfc-securities-top-techno-funda-pick-151671518254003 |access-date=2023-06-08 |website=Mintgenie |language=en}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=PTI |date=21 September 2017 |title=Usha Martin mulls selling either steel or wire rope business |url=https://www.livemint.com/Industry/rJYyDlCC4WqAFlSgCkboHM/Usha-Martin-mulls-selling-either-steel-or-wire-rope-business.html |access-date=2023-06-08 |website=mint |language=en}}</ref>

== Overview==
Usha Martin has manufacturing facilities in many locations in India and internationally. It operates in the United States, the United Kingdom, Dubai, Thailand, and Singapore. It has a wide range of projects and collaborations across different industries.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Das |first=Vipul |date=29 April 2023 |title=Multibagger stock trading 114% above 52-week-low declares 250% dividend: Do you own? |url=https://www.livemint.com/market/stock-market-news/multibagger-stock-trading-114-above-52-week-low-declares-250-dividend-do-you-own-11682786350437.html |access-date=2023-06-08 |website=mint |language=en}}</ref> Some of them include wire rope manufacturing for use in sectors such as oil and gas, mining, elevators, cranes, bridges, and general engineering,<ref>{{Cite web |title=Fire breaks out at one of the world's largest wire rope manufacturing units in Jharkhand |url=https://www.newindianexpress.com/nation/2023/jan/04/fire-breaks-out-at-one-of-the-worlds-largest-wire-rope-manufacturing-units-in-jharkhand-2534290.html |access-date=2023-06-08 |website=The New Indian Express|date=4 January 2023 }}</ref> and for Infrastructure and construction projects like bridges, flyovers and metro rail systems. It also  provides wire ropes and steel products for offshore oil and gas exploration projects like drilling rigs, offshore platforms, and subsea operations.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Basant Jhawar exits Usha Martin |url=https://www.telegraphindia.com/business/basant-jhawar-exits-usha-martin/cid/1687904 |access-date=2023-06-08 |website=www.telegraphindia.com |language=en}}</ref> Some other industries that it caters to are mining industry, elevators/lifts and wind energy. It also has interests in other sectors such as real estate, agriculture, and information technology.<ref>{{Cite web |date=24 June 2020 |title=Usha Martin sees pick-up in demand post monsoon |url=https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/companies/usha-martin-sees-pick-up-in-demand-post-monsoon/article31906830.ece |access-date=2023-06-08 |website=www.thehindubusinessline.com |language=en}}</ref>

== Corporate management==
Vijay Singh Bapna is the chairman while Rajeev Jhawar is the Managing director.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Usha Martin's board reappoints Rajeev Jhawar as managing director for five years |url=https://www.livemint.com/Companies/X8ugzshzu8OMNRYlMjqqeM/Usha-Martins-board-reappoints-Rajeev-Jhawar-as-managing-dir.html |access-date=2018-02-05 |website=FINANCIAL EXPRESS|date=5 February 2018 |last1=Kanungo |first1=Soumonty }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=USHA MARTIN LTD. SHARE PRICE |url=https://www.financialexpress.com/market/usha-martin-ltd-share-price/ |access-date=2023-06-12 |website=FINANCIAL EXPRESS}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=CommunicationtoStockExchangeson27.04.2023–ChangeinDirectorate_20230427175712 |url=https://ushamartin.com/upload/investorrelations/CommunicationtoStockExchangeson27.04.2023%E2%80%93ChangeinDirectorate_20230427175712.pdf |access-date=2023-04-27 |website=Usha Martin Limited}}</ref> The Company Secretary is Manish Agarwal and the Chief Financial Officer is Abhijit Paul

== Subsidiaries==
Usha Martin has subsidiaries like Usha Martin Education & Solutions Limited,<ref>{{Cite web |date=31 May 2023 |title=Usha Martin Edu Standalone March 2023 Net Sales at Rs 0.10 crore, down 44.34% Y-o-Y |url=https://www.moneycontrol.com/news/business/earnings/usha-martin-edu-standalone-march-2023-net-sales-at-rs-0-10-crore-down-44-34-y-o-y-10710211.html |access-date=2023-06-08 |website=Moneycontrol |language=en}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |date=16 June 2022 |title=We Ran A Stock Scan For Earnings Growth And Usha Martin Education & Solutions (NSE:UMESLTD) Passed With Ease |url=https://simplywall.st/stocks/in/consumer-services/nse-umesltd/usha-martin-education-solutions-shares/news/we-ran-a-stock-scan-for-earnings-growth-and-usha-martin-educ |access-date=2023-06-08 |website=simplywall.st}}</ref> Usha Martin Technologies Limited, Usha Martin Infrastructure Limited, Usha Martin International Limited and Usha Beltron Limited.

== Financials==
Usha Martin reported a total income of Rs. 32958.2&nbsp;million during the financial year ended 31 March 2023, compared with Rs.27233.1&nbsp;million during the financial year ended 31 March 2022. The company had a net profit of Rs.3501.4&nbsp;million for the financial year ended 31 March 2023 as against net profit of Rs.2912.7&nbsp;million for the financial year ended 31 March 2022.<ref name="2023FY" /><ref>{{Cite web |date=3 May 2023 |title=Usha Martin Consolidated March 2023 Net Sales at Rs 855.22 crore, up 11.57% Y-o-Y |url=https://www.moneycontrol.com/news/business/earnings/usha-martin-consolidated-march-2023-net-sales-at-rs-855-22-crore-up-11-57-y-o-y-10517981.html |access-date=2023-06-08 |website=Moneycontrol |language=en}}</ref>

